,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Tested between 4.5.1 and 4.6 Beta 2\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - Godot 4.6 Beta 2 - Vulkan, Forward+ - Nvidia RTX 4060 Laptop, Ryzen 7 7840HS\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen opening an Alpha Heavy Scene, Godot's Viewport can have upto a 30% performance difference and increase CPU & GPU times, moving from 4.5.1 Stable to 4.6 Beta 2.\n\nThis is not a case when opening scenes that lack alpha foliage\n\nI've attached full viewport screenshots with version numbers\n\nScenes with extensive foliage:\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6e9df2e9-650b-44d4-8be9-c454b29ba540\" />\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5bdd7e7e-9d75-4044-96ea-3d14c434335a\" />\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/313452dc-48b8-404f-b0c4-48c39833f358\" />\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/17853f32-881d-4e4b-a2d6-1b51ec54bc4b\" />\n\nScenes with minimal foliage:\n\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5b70baa8-47cd-4158-8cb3-7338348481b3\" />\n<img width=\"1919\" height=\"1079\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5845a6d7-03d0-48c5-9496-efd8d2ac1b04\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Download and unzip the MRPs\n- Opening the main scenes (from Demos in MRP)\n- Enable View Frame Time and Info in both 4.5.1 and 4.6 Beta 2\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/Jamsers/Bistro-Demo-Tweaked\n\nhttps://github.com/mikatomik/Godot-4-Overgrown-Subway-Demo","closed_by":{"login":"thedinyamum","id":92639283,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYWQM